          "role": "user",
          "content": "Hi there! I\u2019d like to book a one\u2011way flight from Chicago O\u2019Hare (ORD) to Philadelphia (PHL) for May\u202f26. I want the exact same flight I took on May\u202f10 (I don\u2019t have the flight number handy).  \n\nI\u2019ll be traveling with an additional passenger, Kevin\u202fSmith (DOB\u202f2001\u201104\u201112). We don\u2019t need any checked bags, and we\u2019d like economy seats\u2014an aisle seat for me and a middle seat right next to it for Kevin.  \n\nI\u2019m willing to spend up to $500 total. If the price ends up higher than that, please just book the ticket for me alone.  \n\nWe don\u2019t need travel insurance, and I\u2019d like to pay using one of my certificates only\u2014no other payment method.  \n\nMy name is Sophia\u202fSilva, and my user ID is\u202fsophia_silva_7557. Let me know what you need from me to get this booked.",
