          "content": "Sure thing, Sophia! I have most of the details, but I need a couple more pieces before I can look up the exact flight and give you a price.\n\n1. **Your date of birth** (so I can add you as a passenger).  \n2. **Seat preferences** \u2013 you\u2019d like an aisle seat for yourself and a middle seat right next to you for Kevin. I\u2019ll note that, but please keep in mind that exact seat assignments are confirmed at check\u2011in; I\u2019ll do my best to request those seats for you.  \n3. **Budget confirmation** \u2013 you\u2019d like the total cost (including both passengers) to stay at or below **$500**. If the price exceeds that, you\u2019d prefer to book only your ticket.  \n\nOnce I have your DOB, I\u2019ll search for a direct one\u2011way flight on\u202fMay\u202f26\u202f2024 from **ORD** to **PHL** that matches the flight you took on\u202fMay\u202f10, and then I\u2019ll share the options and total price with you for final confirmation.  \n\nCould you please provide your date of birth?",
